<title>JAPAN: BOT - Mitsubishi says writes off non-taxed bad loans.</title>
<headline>BOT - Mitsubishi says writes off non-taxed bad loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd said on Friday it had finished writing off bad loans which did not require tax payments to be made on them.  </p>
<p>The bank will also carry out bad loan write-offs which require tax payments, but the timing and amount will depend on its earnings results, a senior bank official told a news conference.</p>
</text>
